<main class="write-main"><header><h1>Monthly support</h1><p><a href="<?=url('/write/integration/paypal')?>">← PayPal connection</a> · <a href="<?=url('/contribute/monthly')?>">View monthly giving page</a></p></header>
<?php foreach(flashes()as$f):?><p class="notice" role="status"><?=e($f['message'])?></p><?php endforeach;?><?php if($error):?><p class="notice error"><?=e($error)?></p><?php endif;?>
<section class="settings-card"><h2>PayPal monthly plans</h2><p>Prepare each fixed monthly amount in the selected PayPal app. Plans have no setup fee or automatic outstanding-balance billing. This creates plan definitions, never a supporter subscription.</p><?php foreach(['5.00','10.00','25.00','50.00','100.00']as$amount):?><form method="post" class="monthly-plan-row"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="prepare"><input type="hidden" name="monthly_amount" value="<?=e($amount)?>"><strong>USD <?=e($amount)?> / month</strong><span><?=!empty($cfg['plans'][$amount]['verified'])&&paypal_notifications_current($cfg)?'Verified':'Not prepared'?></span><button class="wbtn">Prepare & verify USD <?=e($amount)?></button></form><?php endforeach;?><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="publish"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" value="1" <?=!empty($cfg['enabled'])&&paypal_notifications_current($cfg)?'checked':''?>>Offer verified plans on the public monthly page</label><button class="wbtn primary">Save monthly giving availability</button></form><p>Public recurring checkout requires live PayPal credentials. Credential changes disable plan availability until this app’s plans are verified again. Subscription notifications use the existing verified PayPal callback.</p></section>
<section class="settings-card"><h2>Monthly support records</h2><p>Amounts below are commitments, not total money received. A provider-reported last payment is shown separately. No subscriber data is published.</p><?php if(!$records):?><p>No monthly support requests yet.</p><?php endif;?><?php foreach($records as$r):?><article><strong><?=e($r['id'])?></strong><p><?=e($r['currency'].' '.$r['amount'])?> / month · <?=e($r['status'])?></p><?php if(!empty($r['last_payment'])):?><p>Last payment reported by PayPal: <?=e($r['last_payment']['amount'].' '.$r['last_payment']['currency'].' · '.$r['last_payment']['time'])?></p><?php endif;?><?php if(!empty($r['review'])):?><p><?=e($r['review'])?></p><?php endif;?><a href="<?=url('/contribute/monthly/manage/'.$r['token'])?>">Manage this private subscription</a></article><?php endforeach;?></section></main>
